:"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_51","text":"You're not giving this your all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_monochrome","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_52","text":"You used to freak out if our timing was off by a microsecond. You insisted that our singing all had to be done live.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_53","text":"You were always cracking the whip at us, demanding that we stay in shape so we could squeeze into our outfits.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_54","text":"And now you're just throwing up your hands and telling me, \"This'll do\"?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_55","text":"What the hell is going on here? You're treating this like an irritating task that you want to get over with as soon as possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_56","text":"If you don't want to do this, just tell me. Don't make me publicly humiliate myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_57","text":"Anis. That's not it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_58","text":"What do you want from us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_59","text":"Are we supposed to leap up and do jumping jacks at the thought of getting back together?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_60","text":"Should we have written a new song, made new costumes, and performed on a massive stage?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_61","text":"I didn't expect all that. I'm not delusional.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_62","text":"You didn't?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_63","text":"Even so, that doesn't mean we should shrug our shoulders and half-ass this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_64","text":"I know it was selfish of me to quit. I ruined everything, and now I come barging in, asking for a farewell performance like nothing ever happened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_65","text":"I know it's shameless.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_66","text":"But I thought at least once, we could...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_67","text":"Once, you say?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_68","text":"Now who's the one half-assing things?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_69","text":"Your only goal is to do a single performance,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_70","text":"so that's what I'm intending to do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_71","text":"You've got some nerve accusing us of not being excited about this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_72","text":"You're only doing this because someone forced you to. It's not because you genuinely wanted to do it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_73","text":"And yet you expect us to give it our all?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_74","text":"How selfish can you be?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_75","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_76","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_77","text":"We used to be close, and that's the only reason we're doing this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_78","text":"So if you're going to do it, do it. If not, then don't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_79","text":"But don't expect us to do any more than is absolutely necessary.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_80","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_81","text":"Hey.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_82","text":"What did you just say?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_83","text":"You're only doing this out of a sense of obligation?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_84","text":"What of it? You expect us to believe that you're doing this for us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_85","text":"We stand to gain nothing from this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_86","text":"Prika.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_87","text":"What? We all know I'm right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_88","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_89","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_90","text":"Okay, that's it. I...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_91","text":"Stop!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_92","text":"??","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_93","text":"Everyone, stop! I can't take any more of this!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_94","text":"I'm Anis's manager, and I won't let you run roughshod over her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_95","text":"Anis shouldn't have to beg on her hands and knees for this. She has more pride than that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_96","text":"She's not doing this for herself. She's doing it with you, together!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_97","text":"Don't be ridiculous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_98","text":"Unlike Anis, we don't regret what we've done in the past. She's doing this for herself, and she doesn't even bring anything to the table.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_99","text":"Yes, she does!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_100","text":"She has songs, outfits, and a stage ready to go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_101","text":"We'll prepare everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_102","text":"All you two need to do is make sure you practice plenty and don't embarrass her later.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_103","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_104","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_105","text":"But Anis isn't going to be going on stage in a few days, I'll tell you that much.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_106","text":"She's not going to tarnish her image by appearing in such a shabby, last-minute event.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_107","text":"We'll handle everything, and before long, you two will be the ones begging to be a part of it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_108","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_109","text":"Do as you wish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_110","text":"Let's go, Anis!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_111","text":"Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_112","text":"Hurry!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_113","text":"Uh... okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_114","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_114","text":"Neon and Anis storm out of the practice room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_115","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_116","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_117","text":"Did we lay it on too thick?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_118","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_118","text":"Hard to tell.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_119","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_119","text":"But if their reactions are any indication, I'd say they didn't suspect anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_120","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_120","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_121","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_121","text":"Nicely done, Prika.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_122","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_122","text":"Provoking her was all your idea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_123","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_123","text":"Haha, you're right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_124","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_124","text":"She may not be a pop star anymore, but Anis is a rising star right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_125","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_125","text":"She has access to far more resources than us, be it a new hit song, flashy outfits, or a bigger stage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_126","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_126","text":"Connections are everything in this business, after all,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_127","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_127","text":"and we're just a pair of broke, washed-up has-beens.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_128","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_128","text":"No one's going to write any songs for us. No one's going to design us new outfits or give us a grand stage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_129","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_129","text":"Aren't you being a bit harsh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_130","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_130","text":"Since the room is full of dreamers, someone has to be a realist.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_131","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_131","text":"I dunno... I don't think I like this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_132","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_132","text":"Was it really necessary to go that far?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_133","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_133","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_134","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_134","text":"I feel like we're using Anis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_135","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_135","text":"Oh, is that it? Then be my guest; tell Anis about our situation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_136","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_136","text":"Tell her we're flat broke and unable to prepare even the most rudimentary concert, and that we desperately need her help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_137","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_137","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_138","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_138","text":"I don't want that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_139","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_139","text":"You see?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_140","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_07_s_140","text":"That's why Anis overshadowing us is the best outcome for us both.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_07_s_141","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint","key":"Locale_Mai